<title>HONG KONG: Kingboard Chem year net down 10 percent.</title>
<headline>Kingboard Chem year net down 10 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   17.0   vs 21.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    4.0    vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    55.93  vs 62.16</p>
<p>    Turnover		     512.90 vs 410.31</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kingboard Chemical Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 19-24</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 8</p>
<p>NOTE - A manufacturer of laminates.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is five H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs 6.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
